1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Chatbots answer questions. Agents
can act. But who approves?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Imagine a grocery list with

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
messy options and changing prices.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
An agent might organize choices and
draft

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
a cart when you've allowed the
tools.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
The trap is letting it buy before

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
you check the total and delivery
address.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,500
My rule: plan first, review sources,

9
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:29,000
preview the action, then approve.

10
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,500
Features vary by app, region and
plan.

11
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:36,000
Don't assume every account can run
tasks.

12
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Save this: good automation keeps

13
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,000
the final decision with you.
